Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-He'll be where?\N-On the front steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[indistinct chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.51,0:00:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[cars accelerate]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[indistinct chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.43,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.\NLook over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Guildmaster Baek\Nfrom the White Tigers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE REPORTER 1]\NAnd Jong-in Choi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,from the Hunters Guild!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.39,0:00:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This place\Nis crawling with press.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Any idea\Nwhat they're doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Are the two of you\Nhere to recruit Minsung Lee?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO]\NWho the hell is Minsung Lee?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not the reason I'm here,\Nso I have no comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As I understand it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Lee has already\Nsigned a contract
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,with the Reaper Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.83,0:00:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We have other business\Nto see to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Woulda really\Nspiced things up, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.87,0:00:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE REPORTER 2]\NJeez, what a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard some news, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,About how the Hunters Guild\Nran into a little trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,with a near S-rank gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't too bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,especially not\Ncompared to the red gate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,that claimed\Na rookie A-rank leader
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.43,0:00:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-from the White Tigers.\N-[Yoonho scoffs]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.97,0:00:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO]\NWay I hear it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.97,0:00:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you were just\Nabout to give us a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:00:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI]\NThankfully, because of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that wasn't necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.64,0:01:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only right\Nfor the Hunters Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.15,0:01:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,to offer a very warm reception\Nto show our gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO]\NOh, don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.15,0:01:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved our asses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus that raid left us\Ndown an A-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.57,0:01:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So you want to fill that spot\Nwith an S-rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like\Nyou're looking to start a war?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.29,0:01:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.45,0:01:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me any of that\Nholier than thou crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[both growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[LIM]\NWell, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,if it isn't Jong-in and Yoonho.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.05,0:01:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.13,0:01:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not here to try to\Nsnatch Minsung from us, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.59,0:01:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH] I told ya I don't give\Na damn about Minsung
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.97,0:01:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,or whatever the hell\Nhis name is!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, sorry I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.10,0:01:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, don't bite my head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.47,0:01:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NThat's a whole lotta people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.98,0:01:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell's goin' on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[STUDENT 1] Check it out!\NIt's Minsung's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,press conference!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[STUDENT 2]\NOh, you mean that actor guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.91,0:03:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[STUDENT 1] Apparently,\Nhe's like a total playboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, they call him...\N-Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[MINSUNG] First off,\NI'd like to thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,for gathering here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As I'm sure you're all aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.71,0:03:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Minsung Lee,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.30,0:03:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,recently awakened as a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And today is the day\Nof my assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've struggled\Nwith this decision
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,from the moment I awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.43,0:03:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But now,\NI've finally made up my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,to bravely\Nconfront my destiny head on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already spoken\Nto Guildmaster Tae-Gyu Lim,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's agreed to let me\Nfight for the Reaper Guild!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're joining a guild,\Nare your acting days over?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE REPORTER 1] Don't you\Nthink this is a bit premature?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:03:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE REPORTER 2]\NWill you mainly be focusing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.49,0:03:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,on your hunter duties?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[MINSUNG]\NHow gullible can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already gotten my A-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My contract with the Reapers\Nis only for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll dabble in hunting\Nlong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,for people to forget\Nall about my scandals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,leverage my A-rank status
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,to push my acting career\Nback into the spotlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.51,0:04:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter\Nwhat rank I end up being,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.97,0:04:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fully prepared\Nto fight with everything I--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[MANAGER] I'm going to need\Nyou to stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see\Nall these reporters?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the way!\NBuzz off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.10,0:04:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...I have business\Nwith the Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[MANAGER]\NIt can wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[MINSUNG] How could\Nthis idiot be so oblivious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go in\Nthrough this entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now get out of here!\N-[GUNHEE] I'm afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,that isn't\Nyour decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[MANAGER] Uh.\NChairman Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, this young man here\Nis a guest of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I seem to recall asking you\Nto refrain
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,from holding a press conference\Nat this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-[gasps] I just--\N-This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come along with me...\N-Thought it would be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.17,0:04:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-good publicity.\N-...Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.63,0:04:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh! What the hell\Nam I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to confer\Nwith the Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, another hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,is being assessed\Nat the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.52,0:05:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid\Nyou won't be able to enter
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.23,0:05:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,until they're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[whispering]\NCome on, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta know who I am, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A single word from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.07,0:05:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're out of a job,\Nmy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to say, but I don't\Nrecognize you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you insist\Non trying to get in,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to remove you\Nfrom the premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NHm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,After hearing about today,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,they came to see\Nyour reassessment in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The prospect\Nof the first S-rank hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to appear in two years\Nhas piqued their interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.01,0:05:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[gate whirring]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.93,0:05:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[ASSOCIATE 1] Before\Nwe begin the reassessment,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to confirm the nature\Nof your hunter abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you mind showing us\Nwhat you can do, Hunter Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, for starters,\NI can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you can create\Nand control a summon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So your specialty\Nis summoning magic, I take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, uh,\NI guess you can say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.41,0:06:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUNHEE]\NHunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Manager Woo has given me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,detailed reports\Nof your abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.91,0:06:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't going\Nto hold out on us, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.37,0:06:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NRight,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,guess the cat's out of the bag\Nat this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.84,0:06:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.01,0:06:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can summon\Naround a hundred more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[ASSOCIATE 1]\ND-did you say a hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.31,0:06:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI]\NHis magic power is tremendous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.31,0:06:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO] That's enough\Nto overwhelm even me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this guy for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He continues to astound me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.45,0:06:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[ASSOCIATE 1]\NThank you for your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reassessment\Nis now complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.41,0:06:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And here is your\Nupdated hunter ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NNice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can sell\Nthe Sphere of Avarice
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,with no problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:06:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I can afford\Nthe gear I need
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,to clear the Demon's Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUNHEE]\NIt's official.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to congratulate you\Non becoming an S-rank Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to seeing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,what you decide to do\Nwith that strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.14,0:07:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I have high hopes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.89,0:07:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI] It's an honor to\Nwelcome the newest S-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you would allow me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,to thank you\Nfor your assistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Our guild is in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And ours too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have some time to chat,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I would love to discuss\Nsomething important with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh.\N-Sorry, guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but I, uh, got some errands\Nto run right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!\NNot there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Huh?\NNot where?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.29,0:07:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-[cameras clicking]\N-Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jinah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINAH]\NYeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...\NWhoa, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.05,0:07:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Stop shaking me.\N-Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother popped up\Non the stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINAH] What?\NHm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.01,0:07:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[FEMALE REPORTER]\NHunter Sung, over here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[reporters clamoring]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.77,0:07:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck\Nis happening over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:08:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK] Hm. That kid\Nreally did make the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you,\Nbut you didn't listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.40,0:08:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried telling you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that he had\Nthe eyes of a killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no knowing\Nwhat messed-up stuff he's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[REPORTER 1] Hunter Sung\Nhas been officially
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,recognized as S-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.95,0:08:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[REPORTER 1]\N...certified announcement yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems his S-rank status\Nhas been confirmed
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in the Association's database!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Which would mean\NJinwoo Sung has now become
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the tenth S-rank hunter\Nin the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The first to emerge\Nin over two years
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,since the awakening\Nof Hunter Cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.05,0:08:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[cameras clicking]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[REPORTER 2]\NAn S-rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait!\NBut this was
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-my press conference.\N-[REPORTER 3] Don't let him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.39,0:08:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,slip away! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINHO]\NI wasn't able to get
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung\Nto accept the offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.69,0:08:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NSorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still something\NI gotta do on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And to do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to keep fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,get even stronger\Nthan I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Joining an organization\Nwould only complicate things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:08:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-[JINWOO] Jinho.\N-Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How 'bout this instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINHO]\NHe, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,he actually asked me\Nto join him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.97,0:09:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[MYUNGHAN]\NI hope you realize
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,how that decision\Nwould be quite selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.31,0:09:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[MYUNGHAN]\NI had every intention
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.23,0:09:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,of letting Jinsung\Nrun this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, you came in\Nand begged me for a chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and despite all\Nof your extravagant claims,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you have accomplished nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you want to run off\Nand work somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to follow\NHunter Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[breathes shakily]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[MYUNGHAN]\NI see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you had best be prepared\Nfor the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:09:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[gulps]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUARD 1]\NEveryone, stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Please keep\Na reasonable distance! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.23,0:10:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUARD 1]\NDon't push!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO] Trust me, you don't\Nwanna deal with the press.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, why don't you let us\Ngive you a lift home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.15,0:10:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.86,0:10:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[reporters clamoring]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite being\Na mage-type hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,his athletic abilities\Nare simply incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Yoonho?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO] He moved so fast\Nmy eyes couldn't track him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even stronger\Nthan he was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.72,0:10:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NIt's time to gear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[APPRAISER 1]\NAh, Hunter Sung,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the market for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,flame-resistant type artifacts,\Nyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,May I inquire\Nabout the specifics?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.61,0:10:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I need protection in\Na dungeon that gets pretty hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[APPRAISER 1]\NOh, I don't blame you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.45,0:10:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,these might be\Njust what you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:11:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A cape you can wear\Non top of your clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and a ring\Nthat's easy to equip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.54,0:11:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[APPRAISER 1] And they should\Nbe well within your budget
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,at these prices.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I maybe get a discount?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.30,0:11:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[appraiser 1 laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[APPRAISER 1]\NWell, my apologies,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.42,0:11:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but the listed prices\Nare the only ones
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,our establishment offers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, you wouldn't have\Nto give us any money whatsoever
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.85,0:11:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're able\Nto shatter this glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything in the case\Nwould be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,\Nit's magically enhanced glass,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,constructed to withstand\Nblows from an A-rank brawler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.86,0:11:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NThis glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense magic power,\Nbut not that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[inhales deeply]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, please don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, it was only a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the glass\Nisn't completely broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,abnormal tremors\Nwill summon security.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Oh, my God...\NI thought you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No.\NNow I see it was in poor taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles softly]\NWell, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:12:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shopping for\Nsome other stuff, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, new daggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[APPRAISER 2]\NExcellent, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.06,0:12:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's weaponry\Nthat you're after
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,allow me to assist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.77,0:12:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps receding]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.56,0:12:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[APPRAISER 1] But,\Nhe only prepared to punch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.94,0:12:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[glass cracks]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.03,0:12:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NOkay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the price?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[APPRAISER 2]\NThat item.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sells for this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.87,0:12:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NFor this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only about as strong\Nas the Venom Fang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.\NUm, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[APPRAISER 2]\NIs there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Nope, just\Ngrabbing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How much would\Nthis guy sell for, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.09,0:12:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[APPRAISER 2]\NIt's certainly impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell the craftsman\Nhad quite the eye for detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Eh, I got this thing\Non sale from the system store.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you,\NI wouldn't accept
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,anything less\Nthan a hundred million.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A hundred mill?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] I only paid\Nlike 3 million gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.31,0:12:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If the store's items\Ngo for this much
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I might not even need to sell\Nthe Sphere of Avarice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.53,0:13:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Can I use\Nyour bathroom real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO] I knew he wasn't\Na lightweight by any means.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What I saw\Ngoes far beyond strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic I sensed\Nin the assessment lab
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.09,0:13:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the athleticism he showed\Noutside of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.21,0:13:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems he's still improving\Neven though his reawakening
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,should have long past,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,which would be a first\Nfor hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he didn't reawaken?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Can a hunter whose strength\Ngrows over time really exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[bird chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.61,0:13:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINAH] [sighs]\NThey finally took a hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.41,0:13:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I can head to school\Nwithout being bombarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.87,0:13:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NBy the press?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.12,0:13:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Association\Nmust've chased them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck! Why'd you have to go\Nand make a huge scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Like, you could've told me you\Nwere gonna be on TV! -Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.63,0:13:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:13:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be out\Nfor about a week
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.71,0:14:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,starting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Again?\NFor work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-[doorbell rings]\N-Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Could you people get the f--\N-Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinho Yoo reporting in, boss!\NYour sidekick is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he a reporter,\Nor some buddy of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,]JINHO] Oh, hi,\Nyou must be Jinwoo's sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm his reliable\Nright-hand man, Jinho Yoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-[JINAH] Uh-huh.\N-Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.74,0:14:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh...\N-This guy and I are going
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.03,0:14:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,on that week-long work trip\Ntomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, as in tomorrow morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-What do you mean?\N-What do I mean. Y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]\NHow could I forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This job has been weighing\Non my shoulders, unbearably!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.75,0:14:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[snoring]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NThey left, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.93,0:14:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,journalists\Nare nothing if not persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. I thought Tusk\Nhad four bodyguards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.27,0:14:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the last one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:15:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot about that guy,\Nsince I kinda put him
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,through the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.57,0:15:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.74,0:15:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Three should be fine\Nsince you're all pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.86,0:15:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You, stay behind\Nand keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm entrusting you with Jinah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] I'll take a few more\Nprecautions while I'm at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.76,0:15:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Start your patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Might make the city\Na bit safer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,come to think of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.81,0:15:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[water burbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINHO] Thanks for letting\Nme stay the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, man, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's your plan\Ngoing forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like he's forcing you\Nto move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta own up\Nto the consequences, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's this job\Nat the DS Tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, you mentioned\Nit would be a week-long thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:15:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I, uh, guess,\Nyou could call it training.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying you're trying\Nto get even stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.38,0:16:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do that after earning\Nan S-rank, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NWhy not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Jinho.\NI'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.\NStay safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NA ring enchanted with water
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.23,0:16:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,a cape with wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.85,0:16:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll keep the heat off\Nnicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The Demon's Castle is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.53,0:16:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a second part?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.45,0:16:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Demon Monarch, Baran,\Nresides on the highest floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.37,0:16:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeat Baran and collect\Nhis soul." Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Rewards are a Rune Stone\Nfor Shadow Exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds\Nlike a necromancy skill!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.42,0:16:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Better reward than last time!\NI'll take the extra motivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to pick up\Nwhere we left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Warp to the 75th floor
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[SANG-MI]\NI can't believe that Jinho
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,would suddenly pack his bags\Nand leave home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you're missing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:16:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A troublesome child\Nhas stretched his wings
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.35,0:17:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and flown the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's really surprising\Nis how long he wait..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.19,0:17:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]\NThat's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's strange, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-[MYUNGHAN] It's getting dark.\N-Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-[thuds]\N-[SANG-MI] Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[rumbling]\N[fire roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[stomping]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.47,0:17:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Time for a test drive.\NYou're up, Tusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.99,0:17:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NBlown clean off its feet
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.15,0:18:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's after\NTusk was nerfed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be more strategic\Nwith that move in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But yeah, the Sphere of Avarice\Nis all yours, Tusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.91,0:18:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[MYUNGHAN]\NI see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Jinho came to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[SANG-MI]\NHe did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.91,0:18:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him\Nyou collapsed from exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.\NDid you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Eternal Sleep Disease?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE DOCTOR] That's correct.\NIt typically begins
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,as abrupt spells of drowsiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.01,0:18:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,then eventually transitions\Ninto a lasting coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.18,0:18:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And how was I infected\Nwith this disease?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.47,0:19:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE DOCTOR] Most likely from\Nprolonged exposure to mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It tends to occur in people\Nwith naturally low resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Yoo,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,are there any hunters\Namong your immediate family?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Our son is a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.41,0:19:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE DOCTOR]\NGranted, we can't be certain
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.57,0:19:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the\Ncause in your case, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[rattling]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[MYUNGHAN]\NThe entire planet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.21,0:19:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,is steeped in magic power\Nthese days,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm intolerant to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the world rejecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I being culled?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE HUNTER 1] Nothing beats\Na peaceful afternoon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.64,0:19:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE HUNTER 2]\NYeah, you said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.31,0:19:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna use what's left of it\Nto fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No slacking, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.69,0:19:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh?\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE HUNTER 2]\NWhat is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[seagulls squawking]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.74,0:19:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Looks like dispatching\Nsix shadow squads
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,is already paying off,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.07,0:20:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,good way to be efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it pretty simple\Nby only giving them
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.87,0:20:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,two orders to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.12,0:20:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,One, slay every enemy\Nthey encounter in their search.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.62,0:20:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, report to me\Nif they find an entry permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.09,0:20:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I am missing out\Non some loot this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.13,0:20:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but I make much\Nfaster progress in exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I was making progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been\Non the 80th floor
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.14,0:20:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't get\Nwhy the pace slowed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.31,0:20:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[exhales]\NWhere's the damn permit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's destroying\Nthe shadows, and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.11,0:20:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's squad A,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.94,0:20:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't think\Nany of these demons
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,would be a problem\Nfor my high orcs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.70,0:20:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta call 'em back,\Nthey're getting thrashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see why, c'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.12,0:20:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[clothes rustle]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Squad B was also\Nmysteriously slaughtered
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.79,0:20:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever is responsible\Nmust be pretty fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.67,0:20:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weird, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.13,0:20:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tusk's squad was the one\Nclosest to squad A
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.80,0:20:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,when it went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.09,0:21:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So why go after squad B next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They're weaker, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.05,0:21:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but they were further away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If this enemy realized\Nthey couldn't beat Tusk,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,they must possess\Nsome level of intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.94,0:21:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And if they're\Ngauging strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know which squad\Nthey'll target next.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.91,0:21:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.82,0:21:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.83,0:21:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.66,0:21:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NMakes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.67,0:21:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder\Nmy weaker shadow squads
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.71,0:21:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,were annihilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.42,0:21:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[spear swinging]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.05,0:21:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[Jinwoo grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[crashes]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.23,0:21:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.60,0:21:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NYou know, I've always wondered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.61,0:21:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do demons like you feel fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.07,0:22:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps approaching]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.15,0:22:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.57,0:22:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I have my answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.50,0:23:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
